{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  MAIN CART — carrinho no visual do checkout (Mater)
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Página /cart com cara de primeira etapa do checkout: etapas no
  topo (Carrinho → Dados → Pagamento), itens em cards, cálculo de
  frete por CEP, resumo do pedido com cupom, "Finalizar compra",
  bandeiras de pagamento e selo de segurança.

  POR QUE NÃO É O CHECKOUT EM SI:
  O checkout da Shopify (dados, endereço, frete e pagamento) é
  hospedado pela própria Shopify e não pode ser editado pelo tema.
  "Finalizar compra" envia o form com name="checkout" e o cliente
  segue para o checkout oficial — que deve ser estilizado no admin
  (Configurações → Checkout → Personalizar) com as mesmas cores.

  PRINCIPAIS PARTES:
  - {% form 'cart' %}: quantidades (updates[]) e checkout. Funciona
    sem JS; com JS os +/- chamam /cart/change.js e recarregam.
  - Barra de frete grátis: setting free_shipping_threshold (R$).
    0 = escondida.
  - Frete por CEP: ViaCEP (viacep.com.br) descobre cidade/UF e a
    Cart API do Shopify (/cart/prepare_shipping_rates.json +
    /cart/async_shipping_rates.json) devolve as tarifas reais da
    loja. As opções são informativas — a escolha final é no checkout.
  - Cupom: /discount/CODIGO?redirect=/cart aplica o código ao
    carrinho; os descontos aplicados aparecem no resumo.
  - Bandeiras: shop.enabled_payment_types (as formas de pagamento
    que a loja realmente aceita), via payment_type_svg_tag.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign threshold_cents = section.settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100
  assign remaining = threshold_cents | minus: cart.total_price
  if threshold_cents > 0
    assign progress = cart.total_price | times: 100 | divided_by: threshold_cents
    if progress > 100
      assign progress = 100
    endif
  endif
-%}

<div class="mcart" id="main-cart-{{ section.id }}">
  {%- comment -%} Etapas {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="mcart__bar">
    <ol class="mcart__steps">
      <li class="is-active"><span>1</span> Carrinho</li>
      <li><span>2</span> Dados</li>
      <li><span>3</span> Pagamento</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mcart__secure">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
      Compra segura
    </p>
  </div>

  {%- if cart.item_count == 0 -%}
    <div class="mcart__empty">
      <p class="mcart__eyebrow">// Carrinho</p>
      <h1 class="mcart__title">Seu carrinho está vazio</h1>
      <p class="mcart__lead">Que tal escolher uma camiseta que expresse a sua fé?</p>
      <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="mcart__cta">
        Ver produtos
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    {%- form 'cart', cart, class: 'mcart__form', id: 'CartForm' -%}
      <div class="mcart__layout">
        {%- comment -%} ---------------- Coluna esquerda ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="mcart__main">
          <p class="mcart__eyebrow">Checkout</p>
          <h1 class="mcart__title">Meu carrinho</h1>
          <p class="mcart__lead">
            {%- if cart.item_count == 1 -%}1 item{%- else -%}{{ cart.item_count }} itens{%- endif %} no seu pedido.
          </p>

          {%- if threshold_cents > 0 -%}
            <div class="mcart__free">
              {%- if remaining > 0 -%}
                <p>Faltam <strong>{{ remaining | money }}</strong> para você ganhar <strong>frete grátis</strong>.</p>
              {%- else -%}
                <p><strong>Parabéns!</strong> Você ganhou frete grátis.</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <div class="mcart__free-track"><span style="width: {{ progress }}%;"></span></div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%} 1. Itens {%- endcomment -%}
          <h2 class="mcart__step-title">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3 4 5.5 2.5 10l3 1.2V21h13v-9.8l3-1.2L20 5.5 15 3c-.4 1.5-1.6 2.5-3 2.5S9.4 4.5 9 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            1. Seus produtos
          </h2>

          <ul class="mcart__items" role="list">
            {%- for item in cart.items -%}
              <li class="mcart__item">
                <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="mcart__item-media" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                  {%- if item.image -%}
                    {{ item.image | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '150, 300', sizes: '140px', alt: '' }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </a>

                <div class="mcart__item-info">
                  <div class="mcart__item-top">
                    <div>
                      <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="mcart__item-name">{{ item.product.title | escape }}</a>
                      {%- unless item.product.has_only_default_variant -%}
                        <p class="mcart__item-variant">{{ item.variant.title | escape }}</p>
                      {%- endunless -%}
                      {%- for property in item.properties -%}
                        {%- assign first_char = property.first | slice: 0 -%}
                        {%- if property.last != blank and first_char != '_' -%}
                          <p class="mcart__item-variant">{{ property.first | escape }}: {{ property.last | escape }}</p>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                      {%- for discount in item.line_level_discount_allocations -%}
                        <p class="mcart__item-discount">{{ discount.discount_application.title | escape }} (−{{ discount.amount | money }})</p>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </div>
                    <div class="mcart__item-price">
                      {%- if item.original_line_price != item.final_line_price -%}
                        <s>{{ item.original_line_price | money }}</s>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <strong>{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</strong>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="mcart__item-bottom">
                    <div class="mcart__qty">
                      <button type="button" class="mcart__qty-btn" data-qty="minus" aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.decrease' | t: product: item.product.title | escape }}">&minus;</button>
                      <input
                        type="number"
                        name="updates[]"
                        value="{{ item.quantity }}"
                        min="0"
                        inputmode="numeric"
                        data-line="{{ forloop.index }}"
                        aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.input_label' | t: product: item.product.title | escape }}"
                      >
                      <button type="button" class="mcart__qty-btn" data-qty="plus" aria-label="{{ 'products.product.quantity.increase' | t: product: item.product.title | escape }}">&plus;</button>
                    </div>
                    <a href="{{ item.url_to_remove }}" class="mcart__remove" aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.remove_title' | t: title: item.product.title | escape }}">
                      {% render 'icon', name: 'trash' %}
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>

          {%- comment -%} 2. Frete {%- endcomment -%}
          <h2 class="mcart__step-title">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
            2. Calcular entrega
          </h2>

          <div class="mcart__shipping" data-shipping>
            <div class="mcart__cep-row">
              <label class="mcart__field">
                <span>CEP</span>
                <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" maxlength="9" placeholder="00000-000" data-cep>
              </label>
              <button type="button" class="mcart__btn-light" data-cep-calc>Calcular</button>
              <a class="mcart__cep-help" href="https://buscacepinter.correios.com.br/app/endereco/index.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Não sei meu CEP</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mcart__cep-place" data-cep-place hidden></p>
            <p class="mcart__cep-error" data-cep-error hidden></p>
            <div class="mcart__rates" data-rates role="radiogroup" aria-label="Opções de entrega"></div>
            <p class="mcart__rates-note" data-rates-note hidden>A forma de entrega é confirmada no próximo passo.</p>
          </div>

          {%- if section.settings.show_note -%}
            <details class="mcart__note" {% if cart.note != blank %}open{% endif %}>
              <summary>Adicionar observação ao pedido {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</summary>
              <textarea name="note" rows="3" placeholder="Ex.: é para presente">{{ cart.note }}</textarea>
            </details>
          {%- endif -%}

          <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="mcart__back">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6 6-6-6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            Continuar comprando
          </a>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} ---------------- Resumo ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
        <aside class="mcart__summary">
          <h2 class="mcart__summary-title">Resumo do pedido</h2>

          <dl class="mcart__totals">
            <div>
              <dt>Subtotal ({{ cart.item_count }} {% if cart.item_count == 1 %}item{% else %}itens{% endif %})</dt>
              <dd>{{ cart.items_subtotal_price | money }}</dd>
            </div>
            {%- for discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}
              <div class="mcart__totals-discount">
                <dt>Desconto · {{ discount.title | escape }}</dt>
                <dd>−{{ discount.total_allocated_amount | money }}</dd>
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
            <div>
              <dt>Entrega</dt>
              <dd data-summary-shipping>Calcule acima</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <div class="mcart__total">
            <span>Total</span>
            <strong data-summary-total data-cart-total="{{ cart.total_price }}">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="mcart__coupon">
            <p class="mcart__coupon-title">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h8l9 9-9 9-9-9Zm4.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z"/></svg>
              Cupom de desconto
            </p>
            <div class="mcart__coupon-row">
              <label class="visually-hidden" for="CartCoupon">Cupom de desconto</label>
              <input type="text" id="CartCoupon" placeholder="Digite seu cupom" autocomplete="off" data-coupon>
              <button type="button" class="mcart__btn-light" data-coupon-apply>Aplicar</button>
            </div>
            {%- if cart.discount_codes.size > 0 -%}
              <ul class="mcart__codes" role="list">
                {%- for code in cart.discount_codes -%}
                  <li class="{% if code.applicable %}is-ok{% else %}is-bad{% endif %}">
                    {{ code.code | escape }}
                    {%- if code.applicable %} aplicado{% else %} não se aplica a este carrinho{% endif -%}
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          <button type="submit" name="checkout" class="mcart__checkout">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
            Finalizar compra
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </button>

          {%- if additional_checkout_buttons and section.settings.show_express -%}
            <div class="mcart__express">{{ content_for_additional_checkout_buttons }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
            <ul class="mcart__payments" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'sections.footer.payment' | t }}">
              {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
                <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'mcart__payment-icon' }}</li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          {%- endif -%}

          <p class="mcart__protected">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 4.5 3.4 8.3 8 9 4.6-.7 8-4.5 8-9V6l-8-3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m8.5 12 2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            Seus dados estão protegidos e criptografados.
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    {%- endform -%}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart {
    --mater-gutter: clamp(20px, 6vw, 100px);
    padding: 0 var(--mater-gutter) clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  /* Etapas */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    margin-bottom: clamp(24px, 3vw, 44px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__steps {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__steps li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__steps li + li::before {
    content: '';
    width: clamp(20px, 4vw, 60px);
    height: 1px;
    margin-right: 4px;
    background-color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__steps span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    font-size: 12px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__steps .is-active { font-weight: 700; opacity: 1; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__steps .is-active span {
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__secure {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* Layout */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 0.72fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 60px);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display-family);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.6vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__lead { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.8; }

  /* Frete grátis */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__free {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    background-color: var(--color-background-contrast);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__free p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__free-track { height: 6px; background-color: var(--color-border); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__free-track span { display: block; height: 100%; background-color: var(--color-accent); transition: width 0.4s ease; }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__step-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px) 0 16px;
    padding-top: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__lead + .mcart__step-title,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__free + .mcart__step-title { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }

  /* Itens */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__items { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: clamp(96px, 11vw, 140px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(14px, 2vw, 22px);
    padding: 14px;
    background-color: var(--color-background-contrast);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-media {
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-media img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-name {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-name:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-variant { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.6; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-discount { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-sale); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-price { display: grid; justify-items: end; align-content: start; font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-price s { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.5; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__item-bottom { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__qty {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--color-background-contrast);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__qty-btn {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__qty-btn:hover { background-color: rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.05); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__qty input {
    width: 44px;
    height: 40px;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    -moz-appearance: textfield;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__qty input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__qty input::-webkit-inner-spin-button { -webkit-appearance: none; margin: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__remove {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.6;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__remove:hover { opacity: 1; color: #b91c1c; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart.is-busy .mcart__items { opacity: 0.5; pointer-events: none; }

  /* Campos */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    flex: 1;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background-color: var(--color-background-contrast);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__field span { font-size: 13px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__field input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__field:focus-within { border-color: var(--color-text); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__btn-light {
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background-color: var(--color-border);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__btn-light:hover { color: var(--color-accent-text); background-color: var(--color-accent); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__btn-light[aria-busy='true'] { opacity: 0.6; pointer-events: none; }

  /* Frete */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__cep-row { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__cep-row .mcart__field { min-width: 200px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__cep-help { align-self: center; font-size: 13px; color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__cep-place { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.75; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__cep-error { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #b91c1c; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__rates { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 14px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__rates:empty { display: none; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mcart__rate {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
